{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0141-linked-list-cycle","title":"LeetCode 141 环形链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0141-linked-list-cycle","wordCount":785,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-141-环形链表\">LeetCode 141 环形链表</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个链表的头节点 <code>head</code>，判断链表中是否有环。</p>\n<p>如果链表中有某个节点，可以通过连续跟踪 <code>next</code> 指针再次到达，则链表中存在环。为了表示给定链表中的环，评测系统内部使用整数 <code>pos</code> 来表示链表尾连接到链表中的位置（索引从 0 开始）。注意：<code>pos</code> 不作为参数进行传递。仅仅是为了标识链表的实际情况。</p>\n<p>如果链表中存在环，则返回 <code>true</code>；否则，返回 <code>false</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中节点的数目范围是 <code>[0, 10⁴]</code></li>\n<li><code>-10⁵ &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 10⁵</code></li>\n<li><code>pos</code> 为 <code>-1</code> 或者链表中的一个有效索引</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = [3,2,0,-4], pos = 1&#10;输出：true&#10;解释：链表中有一个环，其尾部连接到第二个节点\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [3,2,0,-4], pos = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：链表中有一个环，其尾部连接到第二个节点</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = [1,2], pos = 0&#10;输出：true&#10;解释：链表中有一个环，其尾部连接到第一个节点\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [1,2], pos = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：链表中有一个环，其尾部连接到第一个节点</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：head = [1], pos = -1&#10;输出：false&#10;解释：链表中没有环\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：head = [1], pos = -1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：链表中没有环</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>判断链表是否有环是经典的链表问题，有两种主要方法。</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：哈希表</strong></p>\n<p>遍历链表，将每个访问过的节点存入哈希集合（Set）。如果遇到已存在于集合中的节点，说明存在环；如果遍历到 <code>null</code>，说明无环。</p>\n<p>这种方法直观但需要 O(n) 额外空间。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：快慢指针（Floyd 判圈法）</strong></p>\n<p>这是本题最经典的解法，也被称为&quot;龟兔赛跑&quot;算法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>设置两个指针：慢指针 <code>slow</code> 每次走一步，快指针 <code>fast</code> 每次走两步</li>\n<li>如果链表无环，<code>fast</code> 会先到达 <code>null</code></li>\n<li>如果链表有环，<code>fast</code> 和 <code>slow</code> 最终会在环内相遇</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么一定会相遇？</strong> 当两个指针都进入环后，每次迭代 <code>fast</code> 比 <code>slow</code> 多走一步，相当于 <code>fast</code> 以每步 1 的速度追赶 <code>slow</code>。设环长为 C，两者进入环时的距离差为 d，那么经过 C - d 步后 <code>fast</code> 一定会追上 <code>slow</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>直观易理解</td>\n<td>需要额外空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快慢指针</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>空间最优</td>\n<td>需要理解数学证明</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>方法一：快慢指针（推荐）</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function hasCycle(head: ListNode | null): boolean {&#10;  let slow = head;&#10;  let fast = head;&#10;&#10;  while (fast !== null &amp;&amp; fast.next !== null) {&#10;    slow = slow!.next;&#10;    fast = fast.next.next;&#10;&#10;    if (slow === fast) {&#10;      return true;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return false;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hasCycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slow</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fast </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast.next.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (slow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fast) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意循环条件 <code>fast !== null &amp;&amp; fast.next !== null</code> 确保 <code>fast.next.next</code> 不会出现空指针异常。<code>slow</code> 每次走一步，<code>fast</code> 每次走两步，如果存在环，它们一定会相遇。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：哈希表</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function hasCycleHash(head: ListNode | null): boolean {&#10;  const visited = new Set&lt;ListNode&gt;();&#10;  let current = head;&#10;&#10;  while (current !== null) {&#10;    if (visited.has(current)) {&#10;      return true;&#10;    }&#10;    visited.add(current);&#10;    current = current.next;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return false;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hasCycleHash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> visited</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    visited.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>哈希表方法注意要存储<strong>节点引用</strong>而非节点值，因为不同位置的节点可能有相同的值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快慢指针</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>无环时遍历 n 步；有环时最多 n + C 步（C 为环长）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希表</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>最多存储 n 个节点引用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>快慢指针的时间复杂度分析：无环情况下，<code>fast</code> 最多走 n/2 次循环。有环情况下，<code>slow</code> 进入环后，<code>fast</code> 最多再走 C 步追上（C 为环长，C ≤ n），所以总步数不超过 2n。</p>\n<p>本题是 Floyd 算法的基础应用。进阶题 LC #142（环形链表 II）要求找到环的入口节点，需要在两指针相遇后进行第二阶段分析——从相遇点和头节点同时出发，以相同速度行走，再次相遇点即为环入口。这个结论的证明涉及简单的数学推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 141 环形链表","id":"leetcode-141-环形链表"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 83 删除排序链表中的重复元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0083-remove-duplicates-from-sorted-list"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 160 相交链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-linked-list-stack-queue/lc0160-intersection-of-two-linked-lists"}}